          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 18:21; Kumb 14:22-29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Zaka za mazao iwe ni nafaka au matunda ya miti, yote ni mali ya Mwenyezi-Mungu; ni takatifu kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama mtu akitaka kuikomboa zaka yake, atalipa thamani yake na kuongeza asilimia ishirini ya thamani ya zaka hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuhusu mifugo, inapohesabiwa, kila mnyama wa kumi ni mtakatifu kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtu yeyote hana ruhusa kuuliza kama mnyama huyo ni mzuri au mbaya wala mnyama huyo kamwe hatabadilishwa kwa mwingine. Kama akibadilishwa kwa mwingine, wanyama wote wawili watakuwa watakatifu; hawatakombolewa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
